{"1":{"w":[{"c":"الٓر","d":"alif-lam-ra","e":"Alif Laam Ra"},{"c":"تِلْكَ","d":"til'ka","e":"These"},{"c":"ءَايَاتُ","d":"āyātu","e":"(are) the Verses"},{"c":"الْكِتَابِ","d":"l-kitābi","e":"(of) the Book"},{"c":"وَقُرْءَانٍ","d":"waqur'ānin","e":"and Quran"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Alif, Lam, Ra. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur'an."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"رُبَمَا","d":"rubamā","e":"Perhaps"},{"c":"يَوَدُّ","d":"yawaddu","e":"will wish"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they had been"},{"c":"مُسْلِمِينَ","d":"mus'limīna","e":"Muslims"}],"a":{"g":"Perhaps those who disbelieve will wish that they had been Muslims."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"ذَرْهُمْ","d":"dharhum","e":"Leave them"},{"c":"يَأْكُلُوا","d":"yakulū","e":"(to) eat"},{"c":"وَيَتَمَتَّعُوا","d":"wayatamattaʿū","e":"and enjoy"},{"c":"وَيُلْهِهِمُ","d":"wayul'hihimu","e":"and diverted them"},{"c":"الْأَمَلُ","d":"l-amalu","e":"the hope"},{"c":"فَسَوْفَ","d":"fasawfa","e":"then soon"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"they will come to know"}],"a":{"g":"Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted by [false] hope, for they are going to know."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَا","d":"ahlaknā","e":"We destroyed"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"قَرْيَةٍ","d":"qaryatin","e":"town"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"وَلَهَا","d":"walahā","e":"(there was) for it"},{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"a decree"},{"c":"مَعْلُومٌ","d":"maʿlūmun","e":"known"}],"a":{"g":"And We did not destroy any city but that for it was a known decree."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"تَسْبِقُ","d":"tasbiqu","e":"(can) advance"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أُمَّةٍ","d":"ummatin","e":"nation"},{"c":"أَجَلَهَا","d":"ajalahā","e":"its term"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَسْتَءْخِرُونَ","d":"yastakhirūna","e":"(can) delay it"}],"a":{"g":"No nation will precede its term, nor will they remain thereafter."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they say"},{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O you"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(to) whom"},{"c":"نُزِّلَ","d":"nuzzila","e":"has been sent down"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"[on him]"},{"c":"الذِّكْرُ","d":"l-dhik'ru","e":"the Reminder"},{"c":"إِنَّكَ","d":"innaka","e":"indeed you"},{"c":"لَمَجْنُونٌ","d":"lamajnūnun","e":"(are) surely mad"}],"a":{"g":"And they say, \"O you upon whom the message has been sent down, indeed you are mad."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"Why"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَأْتِينَا","d":"tatīnā","e":"you bring to us"},{"c":"بِالْمَلَائِكَةِ","d":"bil-malāikati","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتَ","d":"kunta","e":"you are"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الصَّادِقِينَ","d":"l-ṣādiqīna","e":"the truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Why do you not bring us the angels, if you should be among the truthful?\""}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"نُنَزِّلُ","d":"nunazzilu","e":"We send down"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةَ","d":"l-malāikata","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"with the truth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they would be"},{"c":"إِذًا","d":"idhan","e":"then"},{"c":"مُنْظَرِينَ","d":"munẓarīna","e":"given respite"}],"a":{"g":"We do not send down the angels except with truth; and the disbelievers would not then be reprieved."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"نَزَّلْنَا","d":"nazzalnā","e":"have sent down"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَ","d":"l-dhik'ra","e":"the Reminder"},{"c":"وَإِنَّا","d":"wa-innā","e":"and indeed We"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"of it"},{"c":"لَحَافِظُونَ","d":"laḥāfiẓūna","e":"(are) surely Guardians"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is We who sent down the Qur'an and indeed, We will be its guardian."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We (had) sent"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before you"},{"c":"قَبْلِكَ","d":"qablika","e":"before you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"شِيَعِ","d":"shiyaʿi","e":"the sects"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"(of) the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"And We had certainly sent [messengers] before you, [O Muhammad], among the sects of the former peoples."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَأْتِيهِمْ","d":"yatīhim","e":"came to them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"رَسُولٍ","d":"rasūlin","e":"Messenger"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they did"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"at him"},{"c":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","d":"yastahziūna","e":"mock"}],"a":{"g":"And no messenger would come to them except that they ridiculed him."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"نَسْلُكُهُ","d":"naslukuhu","e":"We let it enter"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"قُلُوبِ","d":"qulūbi","e":"(the) hearts"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمِينَ","d":"l-muj'rimīna","e":"(of) the criminals"}],"a":{"g":"Thus do We insert denial into the hearts of the criminals."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"they believe"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in it"},{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"and verily"},{"c":"خَلَتْ","d":"khalat","e":"have passed"},{"c":"سُنَّةُ","d":"sunnatu","e":"the way(s)"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"(of) the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"They will not believe in it, while there has already occurred the precedent of the former peoples."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And (even) if"},{"c":"فَتَحْنَا","d":"fataḥnā","e":"We opened"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"to them"},{"c":"بَابًا","d":"bāban","e":"a gate"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"فَظَلُّوا","d":"faẓallū","e":"and they were to continue"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"يَعْرُجُونَ","d":"yaʿrujūna","e":"(to) ascend"}],"a":{"g":"And [even] if We opened to them a gate from the heaven and they continued therein to ascend,"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"لَقَالُوا","d":"laqālū","e":"They would surely say"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"سُكِّرَتْ","d":"sukkirat","e":"have been dazzled"},{"c":"أَبْصَارُنَا","d":"abṣārunā","e":"our eyes"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"we"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"مَسْحُورُونَ","d":"masḥūrūna","e":"bewitched"}],"a":{"g":"They would say, \"Our eyes have only been dazzled. Rather, we are a people affected by magic.\""}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَا","d":"jaʿalnā","e":"We have placed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"بُرُوجًا","d":"burūjan","e":"constellations"},{"c":"وَزَيَّنَّاهَا","d":"wazayyannāhā","e":"and We have beautified it"},{"c":"لِلنَّاظِرِينَ","d":"lilnnāẓirīna","e":"for the observers"}],"a":{"g":"And We have placed within the heaven great stars and have beautified it for the observers."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَحَفِظْنَاهَا","d":"waḥafiẓ'nāhā","e":"And We have protected it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْطَانٍ","d":"shayṭānin","e":"devil"},{"c":"رَجِيمٍ","d":"rajīmin","e":"accursed"}],"a":{"g":"And We have protected it from every devil expelled [from the mercy of Allah]"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"(one) who"},{"c":"اسْتَرَقَ","d":"is'taraqa","e":"steals"},{"c":"السَّمْعَ","d":"l-samʿa","e":"the hearing"},{"c":"فَأَتْبَعَهُ","d":"fa-atbaʿahu","e":"then follows him"},{"c":"شِهَابٌ","d":"shihābun","e":"a burning flame"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Except one who steals a hearing and is pursued by a clear burning flame."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"مَدَدْنَاهَا","d":"madadnāhā","e":"We have spread it"},{"c":"وَأَلْقَيْنَا","d":"wa-alqaynā","e":"and [We] cast"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"رَوَاسِيَ","d":"rawāsiya","e":"firm mountains"},{"c":"وَأَنْبَتْنَا","d":"wa-anbatnā","e":"and [We] caused to grow"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"مَوْزُونٍ","d":"mawzūnin","e":"well-balanced"}],"a":{"g":"And the earth - We have spread it and cast therein firmly set mountains and caused to grow therein [something] of every well-balanced thing."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلْنَا","d":"wajaʿalnā","e":"And We have made"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مَعَايِشَ","d":"maʿāyisha","e":"means of living"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"and whom"},{"c":"لَسْتُمْ","d":"lastum","e":"you are not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"بِرَازِقِينَ","d":"birāziqīna","e":"providers"}],"a":{"g":"And We have made for you therein means of living and [for] those for whom you are not providers."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And not"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(is) any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"عِنْدَنَا","d":"ʿindanā","e":"with Us"},{"c":"خَزَائِنُهُ","d":"khazāinuhu","e":"(are) its treasures"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"نُنَزِّلُهُ","d":"nunazziluhu","e":"We send it down"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِقَدَرٍ","d":"biqadarin","e":"in a measure"},{"c":"مَعْلُومٍ","d":"maʿlūmin","e":"known"}],"a":{"g":"And there is not a thing but that with Us are its depositories, and We do not send it down except according to a known measure."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَرْسَلْنَا","d":"wa-arsalnā","e":"And We have sent"},{"c":"الرِّيَاحَ","d":"l-riyāḥa","e":"the winds"},{"c":"لَوَاقِحَ","d":"lawāqiḥa","e":"fertilizing"},{"c":"فَأَنْزَلْنَا","d":"fa-anzalnā","e":"and We sent down"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"فَأَسْقَيْنَاكُمُوهُ","d":"fa-asqaynākumūhu","e":"and We gave it to you to drink"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"of it"},{"c":"بِخَازِنِينَ","d":"bikhāzinīna","e":"(are) retainers"}],"a":{"g":"And We have sent the fertilizing winds and sent down water from the sky and given you drink from it. And you are not its retainers."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّا","d":"wa-innā","e":"And indeed We"},{"c":"لَنَحْنُ","d":"lanaḥnu","e":"surely [We]"},{"c":"نُحْيِي","d":"nuḥ'yī","e":"We give life"},{"c":"وَنُمِيتُ","d":"wanumītu","e":"and We cause death"},{"c":"وَنَحْنُ","d":"wanaḥnu","e":"and We"},{"c":"الْوَارِثُونَ","d":"l-wārithūna","e":"(are) the Inheritors"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and We are the Inheritor."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"عَلِمْنَا","d":"ʿalim'nā","e":"We know"},{"c":"الْمُسْتَقْدِمِينَ","d":"l-mus'taqdimīna","e":"the preceding ones"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"among you"},{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"and verily"},{"c":"عَلِمْنَا","d":"ʿalim'nā","e":"We know"},{"c":"الْمُسْتَءْخِرِينَ","d":"l-mus'takhirīna","e":"the later ones"}],"a":{"g":"And We have already known the preceding [generations] among you, and We have already known the later [ones to come]."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","d":"yaḥshuruhum","e":"will gather them"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"حَكِيمٌ","d":"ḥakīmun","e":"(is) All-Wise"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"All-Knowing"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, your Lord will gather them; indeed, He is Wise and Knowing."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"humankind"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(out) of"},{"c":"صَلْصَالٍ","d":"ṣalṣālin","e":"sounding clay"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"حَمَإٍ","d":"ḥama-in","e":"black mud"},{"c":"مَسْنُونٍ","d":"masnūnin","e":"altered"}],"a":{"g":"And We did certainly create man out of clay from an altered black mud."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْجَانَّ","d":"wal-jāna","e":"And the jinn"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُ","d":"khalaqnāhu","e":"We created it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"نَارِ","d":"nāri","e":"fire"},{"c":"السَّمُومِ","d":"l-samūmi","e":"scorching"}],"a":{"g":"And the jinn We created before from scorching fire."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذْ","d":"wa-idh","e":"And when"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"your Lord said"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord said"},{"c":"لِلْمَلَائِكَةِ","d":"lil'malāikati","e":"to the Angels"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed, I"},{"c":"خَالِقٌ","d":"khāliqun","e":"(will) create"},{"c":"بَشَرًا","d":"basharan","e":"a human being"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(out) of"},{"c":"صَلْصَالٍ","d":"ṣalṣālin","e":"clay"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"حَمَإٍ","d":"ḥama-in","e":"black mud"},{"c":"مَسْنُونٍ","d":"masnūnin","e":"altered"}],"a":{"g":"And [mention, O Muhammad], when your Lord said to the angels, \"I will create a human being out of clay from an altered black mud."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"So when"},{"c":"سَوَّيْتُهُ","d":"sawwaytuhu","e":"I have fashioned him"},{"c":"وَنَفَخْتُ","d":"wanafakhtu","e":"and [I] breathed"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"into him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رُوحِي","d":"rūḥī","e":"My spirit"},{"c":"فَقَعُوا","d":"faqaʿū","e":"then fall down"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to him"},{"c":"سَاجِدِينَ","d":"sājidīna","e":"prostrating"}],"a":{"g":"And when I have proportioned him and breathed into him of My [created] soul, then fall down to him in prostration.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَجَدَ","d":"fasajada","e":"So prostrated"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةُ","d":"l-malāikatu","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"كُلُّهُمْ","d":"kulluhum","e":"all of them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعُونَ","d":"ajmaʿūna","e":"together"}],"a":{"g":"So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely,"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"إِبْلِيسَ","d":"ib'līsa","e":"Iblis"},{"c":"أَبَى","d":"abā","e":"He refused"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"to"},{"c":"يَكُونَ","d":"yakūna","e":"be"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"السَّاجِدِينَ","d":"l-sājidīna","e":"those who prostrated"}],"a":{"g":"Except Iblees, he refused to be with those who prostrated."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"يَاإِبْلِيسُ","d":"yāib'līsu","e":"O Iblis!"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"(is) for you"},{"c":"أَلَّا","d":"allā","e":"that not"},{"c":"تَكُونَ","d":"takūna","e":"you are"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"السَّاجِدِينَ","d":"l-sājidīna","e":"those who prostrated"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, O Iblees, what is [the matter] with you that you are not with those who prostrate?\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"I am not"},{"c":"أَكُنْ","d":"akun","e":"I am not"},{"c":"لِأَسْجُدَ","d":"li-asjuda","e":"(one) to prostrate"},{"c":"لِبَشَرٍ","d":"libasharin","e":"to a human"},{"c":"خَلَقْتَهُ","d":"khalaqtahu","e":"whom You created"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(out) of"},{"c":"صَلْصَالٍ","d":"ṣalṣālin","e":"clay"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"حَمَإٍ","d":"ḥama-in","e":"black mud"},{"c":"مَسْنُونٍ","d":"masnūnin","e":"altered"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"Never would I prostrate to a human whom You created out of clay from an altered black mud.\""}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَاخْرُجْ","d":"fa-ukh'ruj","e":"Then get out"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"of it"},{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"for indeed you"},{"c":"رَجِيمٌ","d":"rajīmun","e":"(are) expelled"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"Then get out of it, for indeed, you are expelled."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"عَلَيْكَ","d":"ʿalayka","e":"upon you"},{"c":"اللَّعْنَةَ","d":"l-laʿnata","e":"(will be) the curse"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"till"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) [the] Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, upon you is the curse until the Day of Recompense.\""}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"O my Lord!"},{"c":"فَأَنْظِرْنِي","d":"fa-anẓir'nī","e":"Then give me respite"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"till"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"يُبْعَثُونَ","d":"yub'ʿathūna","e":"they are raised"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"My Lord, then reprieve me until the Day they are resurrected.\""}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"Then indeed you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"(are) of"},{"c":"الْمُنْظَرِينَ","d":"l-munẓarīna","e":"the ones given respite"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"So indeed, you are of those reprieved"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"Till"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"the Day"},{"c":"الْوَقْتِ","d":"l-waqti","e":"(of) the time"},{"c":"الْمَعْلُومِ","d":"l-maʿlūmi","e":"well-known"}],"a":{"g":"Until the Day of the time well-known.\""}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"Because"},{"c":"أَغْوَيْتَنِي","d":"aghwaytanī","e":"You misled me"},{"c":"لَأُزَيِّنَنَّ","d":"la-uzayyinanna","e":"surely I will make (evil) fair-seeming"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَلَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ","d":"wala-ugh'wiyannahum","e":"and I will mislead them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"[Iblees] said, \"My Lord, because You have put me in error, I will surely make [disobedience] attractive to them on earth, and I will mislead them all"}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"عِبَادَكَ","d":"ʿibādaka","e":"Your slaves"},{"c":"مِنْهُمُ","d":"min'humu","e":"among them"},{"c":"الْمُخْلَصِينَ","d":"l-mukh'laṣīna","e":"the ones who are sincere"}],"a":{"g":"Except, among them, Your chosen servants.\""}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"صِرَاطٌ","d":"ṣirāṭun","e":"(is) the way"},{"c":"عَلَيَّ","d":"ʿalayya","e":"to Me"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِيمٌ","d":"mus'taqīmun","e":"straight"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"This is a path [of return] to Me [that is] straight."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"عِبَادِي","d":"ʿibādī","e":"My slaves"},{"c":"لَيْسَ","d":"laysa","e":"not"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"you have"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"over them"},{"c":"سُلْطَانٌ","d":"sul'ṭānun","e":"any authority"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"those who"},{"c":"اتَّبَعَكَ","d":"ittabaʿaka","e":"follow you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْغَاوِينَ","d":"l-ghāwīna","e":"the ones who go astray"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, My servants - no authority will you have over them, except those who follow you of the deviators."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"Hell"},{"c":"لَمَوْعِدُهُمْ","d":"lamawʿiduhum","e":"(is) surely the promised place for them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, Hell is the promised place for them all."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"For it"},{"c":"سَبْعَةُ","d":"sabʿatu","e":"(are) seven"},{"c":"أَبْوَابٍ","d":"abwābin","e":"gates"},{"c":"لِكُلِّ","d":"likulli","e":"for each"},{"c":"بَابٍ","d":"bābin","e":"gate"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"جُزْءٌ","d":"juz'on","e":"(is) a portion"},{"c":"مَقْسُومٌ","d":"maqsūmun","e":"assigned"}],"a":{"g":"It has seven gates; for every gate is of them a portion designated.\""}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"وَعُيُونٍ","d":"waʿuyūnin","e":"and water springs"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be within gardens and springs."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"ادْخُلُوهَا","d":"ud'khulūhā","e":"Enter it"},{"c":"بِسَلَامٍ","d":"bisalāmin","e":"in peace"},{"c":"ءَامِنِينَ","d":"āminīna","e":"secure"}],"a":{"g":"[Having been told], \"Enter it in peace, safe [and secure].\""}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَزَعْنَا","d":"wanazaʿnā","e":"And We (will) remove"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"صُدُورِهِمْ","d":"ṣudūrihim","e":"their breasts"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"غِلٍّ","d":"ghillin","e":"rancor"},{"c":"إِخْوَانًا","d":"ikh'wānan","e":"(they will be) brothers"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"سُرُرٍ","d":"sururin","e":"thrones"},{"c":"مُتَقَابِلِينَ","d":"mutaqābilīna","e":"facing each other"}],"a":{"g":"And We will remove whatever is in their breasts of resentment, [so they will be] brothers, on thrones facing each other."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَمَسُّهُمْ","d":"yamassuhum","e":"will touch them"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"نَصَبٌ","d":"naṣabun","e":"fatigue"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"from it"},{"c":"بِمُخْرَجِينَ","d":"bimukh'rajīna","e":"will be removed"}],"a":{"g":"No fatigue will touch them therein, nor from it will they [ever] be removed."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"نَبِّئْ","d":"nabbi","e":"Inform"},{"c":"عِبَادِي","d":"ʿibādī","e":"My slaves"},{"c":"أَنِّي","d":"annī","e":"that I"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"الْغَفُورُ","d":"l-ghafūru","e":"the Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمُ","d":"l-raḥīmu","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"[O Muhammad], inform My servants that it is I who am the Forgiving, the Merciful."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنَّ","d":"wa-anna","e":"And that"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"الْعَذَابُ","d":"l-ʿadhābu","e":"(is) the punishment"},{"c":"الْأَلِيمُ","d":"l-alīmu","e":"the most painful"}],"a":{"g":"And that it is My punishment which is the painful punishment."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَبِّئْهُمْ","d":"wanabbi'hum","e":"And inform them"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"about"},{"c":"ضَيْفِ","d":"ḍayfi","e":"(the) guests"},{"c":"إِبْرَاهِيمَ","d":"ib'rāhīma","e":"(of) Ibrahim"}],"a":{"g":"And inform them about the guests of Abraham,"}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"دَخَلُوا","d":"dakhalū","e":"they entered"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"upon him"},{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"and said"},{"c":"سَلَامًا","d":"salāman","e":"Peace"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"(are) of you"},{"c":"وَجِلُونَ","d":"wajilūna","e":"afraid"}],"a":{"g":"When they entered upon him and said, \"Peace.\" [Abraham] said, \"Indeed, we are fearful of you.\""}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَوْجَلْ","d":"tawjal","e":"be afraid"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"indeed we"},{"c":"نُبَشِّرُكَ","d":"nubashiruka","e":"[we] bring glad tidings to you"},{"c":"بِغُلَامٍ","d":"bighulāmin","e":"of a boy"},{"c":"عَلِيمٍ","d":"ʿalīmin","e":"learned"}],"a":{"g":"[The angels] said, \"Fear not. Indeed, we give you good tidings of a learned boy.\""}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"أَبَشَّرْتُمُونِي","d":"abashartumūnī","e":"Do you give me glad tidings"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"Do you give me glad tidings"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"although"},{"c":"مَسَّنِيَ","d":"massaniya","e":"has overtaken me"},{"c":"الْكِبَرُ","d":"l-kibaru","e":"old age"},{"c":"فَبِمَ","d":"fabima","e":"Then about what"},{"c":"تُبَشِّرُونَ","d":"tubashirūna","e":"you give glad tidings"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"Have you given me good tidings although old age has come upon me? Then of what [wonder] do you inform?\""}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"بَشَّرْنَاكَ","d":"basharnāka","e":"We give you glad tidings"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"so (do) not"},{"c":"تَكُنْ","d":"takun","e":"be"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْقَانِطِينَ","d":"l-qāniṭīna","e":"the despairing"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"We have given you good tidings in truth, so do not be of the despairing.\""}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And who"},{"c":"يَقْنَطُ","d":"yaqnaṭu","e":"despairs"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رَحْمَةِ","d":"raḥmati","e":"(the) Mercy"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"(of) his Lord"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الضَّالُّونَ","d":"l-ḍālūna","e":"those who are astray"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"And who despairs of the mercy of his Lord except for those astray?\""}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"Then what"},{"c":"خَطْبُكُمْ","d":"khaṭbukum","e":"(is) your business"},{"c":"أَيُّهَا","d":"ayyuhā","e":"O messengers"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"l-mur'salūna","e":"O messengers"}],"a":{"g":"[Abraham] said, \"Then what is your business [here], O messengers?\""}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"أُرْسِلْنَا","d":"ur'sil'nā","e":"[we] have been sent"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"قَوْمٍ","d":"qawmin","e":"a people"},{"c":"مُجْرِمِينَ","d":"muj'rimīna","e":"criminals"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Indeed, we have been sent to a people of criminals,"}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"ءَالَ","d":"āla","e":"the family"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"of Lut"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"indeed we"},{"c":"لَمُنَجُّوهُمْ","d":"lamunajjūhum","e":"surely will save them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"Except the family of Lot; indeed, we will save them all"}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"امْرَأَتَهُ","d":"im'ra-atahu","e":"his wife"},{"c":"قَدَّرْنَا","d":"qaddarnā","e":"We have decreed"},{"c":"إِنَّهَا","d":"innahā","e":"that she"},{"c":"لَمِنَ","d":"lamina","e":"(is) surely of"},{"c":"الْغَابِرِينَ","d":"l-ghābirīna","e":"those who remain behind"}],"a":{"g":"Except his wife.\" Allah decreed that she is of those who remain behind."}},"61":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَمَّا","d":"falammā","e":"And when"},{"c":"جَاءَ","d":"jāa","e":"came"},{"c":"ءَالَ","d":"āla","e":"(to the) family"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"(of) Lut"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"l-mur'salūna","e":"the messengers"}],"a":{"g":"And when the messengers came to the family of Lot,"}},"62":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"Indeed you"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"مُنْكَرُونَ","d":"munkarūna","e":"unknown"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"Indeed, you are people unknown.\""}},"63":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"جِئْنَاكَ","d":"ji'nāka","e":"we have come to you"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"with what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"in it"},{"c":"يَمْتَرُونَ","d":"yamtarūna","e":"disputing"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"But we have come to you with that about which they were disputing,"}},"64":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَتَيْنَاكَ","d":"wa-ataynāka","e":"And we have come to you"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"with the truth"},{"c":"وَإِنَّا","d":"wa-innā","e":"and indeed we"},{"c":"لَصَادِقُونَ","d":"laṣādiqūna","e":"surely (are) truthful"}],"a":{"g":"And we have come to you with truth, and indeed, we are truthful."}},"65":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَسْرِ","d":"fa-asri","e":"So travel"},{"c":"بِأَهْلِكَ","d":"bi-ahlika","e":"with your family"},{"c":"بِقِطْعٍ","d":"biqiṭ'ʿin","e":"in a portion"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"وَاتَّبِعْ","d":"wa-ittabiʿ","e":"and follow"},{"c":"أَدْبَارَهُمْ","d":"adbārahum","e":"their backs"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَلْتَفِتْ","d":"yaltafit","e":"let look back"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"among you"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"},{"c":"وَامْضُوا","d":"wa-im'ḍū","e":"and go on"},{"c":"حَيْثُ","d":"ḥaythu","e":"where"},{"c":"تُؤْمَرُونَ","d":"tu'marūna","e":"you are ordered"}],"a":{"g":"So set out with your family during a portion of the night and follow behind them and let not anyone among you look back and continue on to where you are commanded.\""}},"66":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَضَيْنَا","d":"waqaḍaynā","e":"And We conveyed"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"[that]"},{"c":"الْأَمْرَ","d":"l-amra","e":"the matter"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"دَابِرَ","d":"dābira","e":"(the) root"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"(of) these"},{"c":"مَقْطُوعٌ","d":"maqṭūʿun","e":"would be cut off"},{"c":"مُصْبِحِينَ","d":"muṣ'biḥīna","e":"(by) early morning"}],"a":{"g":"And We conveyed to him [the decree] of that matter: that those [sinners] would be eliminated by early morning."}},"67":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَ","d":"wajāa","e":"And came"},{"c":"أَهْلُ","d":"ahlu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"الْمَدِينَةِ","d":"l-madīnati","e":"(of) the city"},{"c":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","d":"yastabshirūna","e":"rejoicing"}],"a":{"g":"And the people of the city came rejoicing."}},"68":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"ضَيْفِي","d":"ḍayfī","e":"(are) my guests"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"so (do) not"},{"c":"تَفْضَحُونِ","d":"tafḍaḥūni","e":"shame me"}],"a":{"g":"[Lot] said, \"Indeed, these are my guests, so do not shame me."}},"69":{"w":[{"c":"وَاتَّقُوا","d":"wa-ittaqū","e":"And fear"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تُخْزُونِ","d":"tukh'zūni","e":"disgrace me"}],"a":{"g":"And fear Allah and do not disgrace me.\""}},"70":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"نَنْهَكَ","d":"nanhaka","e":"we forbid you"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"from"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"the world"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Have we not forbidden you from [protecting] people?\""}},"71":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"These"},{"c":"بَنَاتِي","d":"banātī","e":"(are) my daughters"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you would be"},{"c":"فَاعِلِينَ","d":"fāʿilīna","e":"doers"}],"a":{"g":"[Lot] said, \"These are my daughters - if you would be doers [of lawful marriage].\""}},"72":{"w":[{"c":"لَعَمْرُكَ","d":"laʿamruka","e":"By your life"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"indeed they"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"were in"},{"c":"سَكْرَتِهِمْ","d":"sakratihim","e":"their intoxication"},{"c":"يَعْمَهُونَ","d":"yaʿmahūna","e":"wandering blindly"}],"a":{"g":"By your life, [O Muhammad], indeed they were, in their intoxication, wandering blindly."}},"73":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","d":"fa-akhadhathumu","e":"So seized them"},{"c":"الصَّيْحَةُ","d":"l-ṣayḥatu","e":"the awful cry"},{"c":"مُشْرِقِينَ","d":"mush'riqīna","e":"at sunrise"}],"a":{"g":"So the shriek seized them at sunrise."}},"74":{"w":[{"c":"فَجَعَلْنَا","d":"fajaʿalnā","e":"And We made"},{"c":"عَالِيَهَا","d":"ʿāliyahā","e":"its highest (part)"},{"c":"سَافِلَهَا","d":"sāfilahā","e":"its lowest"},{"c":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","d":"wa-amṭarnā","e":"and We rained"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"حِجَارَةً","d":"ḥijāratan","e":"stones"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"سِجِّيلٍ","d":"sijjīlin","e":"baked clay"}],"a":{"g":"And We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of hard clay."}},"75":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"(are) the Signs"},{"c":"لِلْمُتَوَسِّمِينَ","d":"lil'mutawassimīna","e":"for those who discern"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed in that are signs for those who discern."}},"76":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهَا","d":"wa-innahā","e":"And indeed it"},{"c":"لَبِسَبِيلٍ","d":"labisabīlin","e":"(is) on a road"},{"c":"مُقِيمٍ","d":"muqīmin","e":"established"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, those cities are [situated] on an established road."}},"77":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَةً","d":"laāyatan","e":"surely (is) a Sign"},{"c":"لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"lil'mu'minīna","e":"for the believers"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed in that is a sign for the believers."}},"78":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And were"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"And were"},{"c":"أَصْحَابُ","d":"aṣḥābu","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْأَيْكَةِ","d":"l-aykati","e":"(of) the wood"},{"c":"لَظَالِمِينَ","d":"laẓālimīna","e":"surely wrongdoers"}],"a":{"g":"And the companions of the thicket were [also] wrongdoers."}},"79":{"w":[{"c":"فَانْتَقَمْنَا","d":"fa-intaqamnā","e":"So We took retribution"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from them"},{"c":"وَإِنَّهُمَا","d":"wa-innahumā","e":"and indeed they both"},{"c":"لَبِإِمَامٍ","d":"labi-imāmin","e":"(were) on a highway"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"So We took retribution from them, and indeed, both [cities] are on a clear highway."}},"80":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"denied"},{"c":"أَصْحَابُ","d":"aṣḥābu","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْحِجْرِ","d":"l-ḥij'ri","e":"(of) the Rocky Tract"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلِينَ","d":"l-mur'salīna","e":"the Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"And certainly did the companions of Thamud deny the messengers."}},"81":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاتَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"waātaynāhum","e":"And We gave them"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِنَا","d":"āyātinā","e":"Our Signs"},{"c":"فَكَانُوا","d":"fakānū","e":"but they were"},{"c":"عَنْهَا","d":"ʿanhā","e":"from them"},{"c":"مُعْرِضِينَ","d":"muʿ'riḍīna","e":"turning away"}],"a":{"g":"And We gave them Our signs, but from them they were turning away."}},"82":{"w":[{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"And they used (to)"},{"c":"يَنْحِتُونَ","d":"yanḥitūna","e":"carve"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْجِبَالِ","d":"l-jibāli","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"بُيُوتًا","d":"buyūtan","e":"houses"},{"c":"ءَامِنِينَ","d":"āminīna","e":"secure"}],"a":{"g":"And they used to carve from the mountains, houses, feeling secure."}},"83":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","d":"fa-akhadhathumu","e":"But seized them"},{"c":"الصَّيْحَةُ","d":"l-ṣayḥatu","e":"the awful cry"},{"c":"مُصْبِحِينَ","d":"muṣ'biḥīna","e":"(at) early morning"}],"a":{"g":"But the shriek seized them at early morning."}},"84":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَغْنَى","d":"aghnā","e":"availed"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"them"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَكْسِبُونَ","d":"yaksibūna","e":"earn"}],"a":{"g":"So nothing availed them [from] what they used to earn."}},"85":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"السَّاعَةَ","d":"l-sāʿata","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"لَءَاتِيَةٌ","d":"laātiyatun","e":"(is) surely coming"},{"c":"فَاصْفَحِ","d":"fa-iṣ'faḥi","e":"So overlook"},{"c":"الصَّفْحَ","d":"l-ṣafḥa","e":"(with) forgiveness"},{"c":"الْجَمِيلَ","d":"l-jamīla","e":"gracious"}],"a":{"g":"And We have not created the heavens and earth and that between them except in truth. And indeed, the Hour is coming; so forgive with gracious forgiveness."}},"86":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الْخَلَّاقُ","d":"l-khalāqu","e":"(is) the Creator"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, your Lord - He is the Knowing Creator."}},"87":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْنَاكَ","d":"ātaynāka","e":"We have given you"},{"c":"سَبْعًا","d":"sabʿan","e":"seven"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمَثَانِي","d":"l-mathānī","e":"the oft-repeated"},{"c":"وَالْقُرْءَانَ","d":"wal-qur'āna","e":"and the Quran"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمَ","d":"l-ʿaẓīma","e":"Great"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly given you, [O Muhammad], seven of the often repeated [verses] and the great Qur'an."}},"88":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَمُدَّنَّ","d":"tamuddanna","e":"extend"},{"c":"عَيْنَيْكَ","d":"ʿaynayka","e":"your eyes"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"towards"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"مَتَّعْنَا","d":"mattaʿnā","e":"We have bestowed"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with it"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجًا","d":"azwājan","e":"(to) categories"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"of them"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَحْزَنْ","d":"taḥzan","e":"grieve"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"over them"},{"c":"وَاخْفِضْ","d":"wa-ikh'fiḍ","e":"And lower"},{"c":"جَنَاحَكَ","d":"janāḥaka","e":"your wing"},{"c":"لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"lil'mu'minīna","e":"to the believers"}],"a":{"g":"Do not extend your eyes toward that by which We have given enjoyment to [certain] categories of the disbelievers, and do not grieve over them. And lower your wing to the believers"}},"89":{"w":[{"c":"وَقُلْ","d":"waqul","e":"And say"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"[I] am"},{"c":"النَّذِيرُ","d":"l-nadhīru","e":"a warner"},{"c":"الْمُبِينُ","d":"l-mubīnu","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And say, \"Indeed, I am the clear warner\" -"}},"90":{"w":[{"c":"كَمَا","d":"kamā","e":"As"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَا","d":"anzalnā","e":"We sent down"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الْمُقْتَسِمِينَ","d":"l-muq'tasimīna","e":"those who divided"}],"a":{"g":"Just as We had revealed [scriptures] to the separators"}},"91":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"جَعَلُوا","d":"jaʿalū","e":"have made"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"عِضِينَ","d":"ʿiḍīna","e":"(in) parts"}],"a":{"g":"Who have made the Qur'an into portions."}},"92":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَرَبِّكَ","d":"fawarabbika","e":"So by your Lord"},{"c":"لَنَسْءَلَنَّهُمْ","d":"lanasalannahum","e":"surely We will question them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"So by your Lord, We will surely question them all"}},"93":{"w":[{"c":"عَمَّا","d":"ʿammā","e":"About what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَعْمَلُونَ","d":"yaʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"About what they used to do."}},"94":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْدَعْ","d":"fa-iṣ'daʿ","e":"So proclaim"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تُؤْمَرُ","d":"tu'maru","e":"you are ordered"},{"c":"وَأَعْرِضْ","d":"wa-aʿriḍ","e":"and turn away"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"from"},{"c":"الْمُشْرِكِينَ","d":"l-mush'rikīna","e":"the polytheists"}],"a":{"g":"Then declare what you are commanded and turn away from the polytheists."}},"95":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"كَفَيْنَاكَ","d":"kafaynāka","e":"[We] are sufficient for you"},{"c":"الْمُسْتَهْزِءِينَ","d":"l-mus'tahziīna","e":"(against) the mockers"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We are sufficient for you against the mockers"}},"96":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"يَجْعَلُونَ","d":"yajʿalūna","e":"set up"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِلَهًا","d":"ilāhan","e":"god"},{"c":"ءَاخَرَ","d":"ākhara","e":"another"},{"c":"فَسَوْفَ","d":"fasawfa","e":"But soon"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"they will come to know"}],"a":{"g":"Who make [equal] with Allah another deity. But they are going to know."}},"97":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"نَعْلَمُ","d":"naʿlamu","e":"We know"},{"c":"أَنَّكَ","d":"annaka","e":"that [you]"},{"c":"يَضِيقُ","d":"yaḍīqu","e":"(is) straitened"},{"c":"صَدْرُكَ","d":"ṣadruka","e":"your breast"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"by what"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"they say"}],"a":{"g":"And We already know that your breast is constrained by what they say."}},"98":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَبِّحْ","d":"fasabbiḥ","e":"So glorify"},{"c":"بِحَمْدِ","d":"biḥamdi","e":"with the praise"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"وَكُنْ","d":"wakun","e":"and be"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"السَّاجِدِينَ","d":"l-sājidīna","e":"those who prostrate"}],"a":{"g":"So exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord and be of those who prostrate [to Him]."}},"99":{"w":[{"c":"وَاعْبُدْ","d":"wa-uʿ'bud","e":"And worship"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"يَأْتِيَكَ","d":"yatiyaka","e":"comes to you"},{"c":"الْيَقِينُ","d":"l-yaqīnu","e":"the certainty"}],"a":{"g":"And worship your Lord until there comes to you the certainty (death)."}}}